# Order Production subrows before Plan steps

Reorder expanded plan details so production/card-stat rows precede ordered construction-step rows.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] An expanded construction plan shows its Production/card-stat group before its ordered Plan-step group.
- [ ] The Production group retains exactly five resource rows in Brick, Wood, Hay, Sheep, Ore order.
- [ ] Ordered Road, Settlement, and City steps retain their saved order after the Production rows.
- [ ] Expanded production checks continue to show their applicable Production rows without an empty step group.
- [ ] Group labels and icon-only subrows retain the hierarchy inset introduced by TASK-032.
- [ ] Fixed labels/icons and scrolling values remain vertically aligned after reordering.
- [ ] Stable row identities preserve smooth expansion, collapse, scrolling, and section switching.
- [ ] Domain row-order and UI regression coverage compile.
- [ ] Focused expansion/alignment checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.
